{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/setsumei1.png?t=1745154730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spring has not come to the naturally blessed island of Esidesi! Two fairies noticed this anomaly and set out on an adventure to bring spring to the people of the village. In order to bring back spring, they must pass through dangerous places. Choose between \u201cPETTY,\u201d who loves spring, and \u201cKABURA,\u201d a boy fairy who doesn't really like spring but loves PETTY, and proceed with your attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/setsumei2.png?t=1745154730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the usual shots, make use of three types of weapon items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also items available to strengthen the player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the best combination of items for each stage and boss to conquer them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage is set on the nature-rich island of Esideci, but the two protagonists are faced with a variety of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage is set on the nature-rich island of Esidesi, but the two heroes are confronted by enemies who attack in a variety of ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapon Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/icon_m.png?t=1745154730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cocobat Missile  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fires missiles up and down. Particularly effective against enemies on the ceiling or ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/icon_l.png?t=1745154730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solar Laser  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This weapon goes straight and deals high damage. Perfect for hard enemies and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/icon_n.png?t=1745154730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nut Blade  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can attack forward and backward. Ideal for enemies approaching from behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enhanced Item</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/icon_f.png?t=1745154730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly Butterfly</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An invincible support character with no ground or collision detection. Movement changes depending on the player character selected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/icon_b.png?t=1745154730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vivaldi Barrier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A barrier is deployed to protect the player from enemy bullets, but it disappears when the player is hit by many bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/icon_s.png?t=1745154730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's movement will become faster, but if you take more than 4, you will be the slowest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two player characters \u201cPETTY\u201d and \u201cKABURA\u201d can be chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable, fantastical, pop, and slightly strange world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1