many bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/icon_s.png?t=1745154730\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed Up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's movement will become faster, but if you take more than 4, you will be the slowest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two player characters \u201cPETTY\u201d and \u201cKABURA\u201d can be chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable, fantastical, pop, and slightly strange world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["\u7fbd\u826f\u9ebb\u30bb\u30eb\u30d5"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/69169898649c8ee9394cea43631bda6f395202f7/header.jpg?t=1745154730","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126875,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126875/movie480.mp4?t=1744833842","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126875/movie_max.mp4?t=1744833842"},"name":"Promotional Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126875/4238f3c1b541facd01b4e83a02f3245212d82149/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744833842","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126875/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744833842","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126875/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744833842"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257124990,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124990/movie480.mp4?t=1744833850","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124990/movie_max.mp4?t=1744833850"},"name":"Gameplay Video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/